<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Protection Paladins</span></h2>This list represents the best overall gear available prior to entering Raids in Mist of Pandaria Classic Phase 3. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%;">
<div id="dsf67g4d-mop-phase-3-pre-bis">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-href="#mop-phase-3-pre-bis-phase-3-pre-bis" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_sword_1h_pandaraid_d_01.jpg");'></span>Phase 3 Pre-BIS</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-mop-phase-3-pre-bis-phase-3-pre-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This set of gear is considered optimal for gearing a new character without access to raid drops. The sets intentionally do not include World Boss drops. If you get lucky and acquire an item from Oondasta or Nalak, these are typically a direct upgrade over any item listed in these sets and should be built around specifically. <br/>
<br/>
