<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Protection Paladins</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear, in particular from World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is a world boss located on the Isle of Giants, off the northern coast of Kun-Lai Summit. , Oondasta drops loot equivalent to Normal Throne of Thunder gear, making all drops a strict upgrade over Celestial Dungeon rewards.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95192/belt-of-the-tyrannotitan">
