<img alt="Breastplate of the Iguanocolossus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the Iguanocolossus</span></a></div></li>
<li>
