<img alt="Braided Black and White Bracer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Braided Black and White Bracer</span></a></td>
<td>1750 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
